      Say\u0131m\u0131 sadece sen g\xF6r\xFCrs\xFCn ve el bitene kadar sende kal\u0131r."
  - Key: item.deck_count.notice
    Value: "desteyi sayd\u0131"
  - Key: item.extra_draw.name
    Value: Kusmuk
  - Key: item.extra_draw.description
    Value: "Desteden bir kart daha \xE7ek. Bu elin sonuna kadar \xE7ekilemezsin."
  - Key: item.extra_draw.notice
    Value: "fazladan kart \xE7ekti"
  - Key: item.half_dose.name
    Value: "\u015E\u0131r\u0131nga"
  - Key: item.half_dose.description
    Value: "Bir oyuncu se\xE7: \xF6l\xFCm oran\u0131 yar\u0131ya iner, sonra kalan
