    Value: "Palya\xE7o Kutusu"
  - Key: item.joker_card.description
    Value: "%50 ihtimalle elinden se\xE7ti\u011Fin bir kart Joker olur. Tutup tutmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
