  - Key: item.peek_board.name
    Value: Spatula
  - Key: item.peek_board.description
    Value: "Bir masa kart\u0131n\u0131 a\xE7\u0131lmadan \xF6nce g\xF6r. Bu tur \xE7ekilemezsin."
