  - Key: item.rate_shift.prompt
    Value: "DOZUNU OYNATACA\u011EIN K\u0130\u015E\u0130Y\u0130 \u0130\u015EARET ET"
  - Key: item.shared_roll.name
    Value: Bira
  - Key: item.shared_roll.description
    Value: "Sen ve se\xE7ti\u011Fin oyuncu ayn\u0131 anda, her biriniz kendi \xF6l\xFCm
      oran\u0131na kar\u015F\u0131 zar atars\u0131n\u0131z."
  - Key: item.shared_roll.notice
    Value: "birlikte zar att\u0131 \u2192"
  - Key: item.shared_roll.prompt
    Value: "SEN\u0130NLE ZAR ATACAK K\u0130\u015E\u0130Y\u0130 \u0130\u015EARET ET"
  - Key: item.swap_board.name
    Value: Sigara
  - Key: item.swap_board.description
    Value: "Kapal\u0131 bir masa kart\u0131 herkese a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r, sonra kartlar\u0131ndan
      biriyle de\u011Fi\u015Ftirilir; o kart masada a\xE7\u0131k kal\u0131r."
  - Key: item.swap_board.notice
    Value: "masayla kart de\u011Fi\u015Ftirdi"
  - Key: item.swap_board.prompt
    Value: "MASAYA KOYACA\u011EIN KARTI \u0130\u015EARET ET"
  - Key: item.swap_hand.name
    Value: "B\u0131\xE7ak"
  - Key: item.swap_hand.description
    Value: "H\xE2l\xE2 elde olan bir oyuncuyla bir kart\u0131n\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Ftir.
      Hangi kart\u0131n\u0131 verece\u011Fini o se\xE7er."
  - Key: item.swap_hand.notice
    Value: "kart de\u011Fi\u015Ftirdi \u2192"
  - Key: item.swap_hand.prompt_own
    Value: "VERECE\u011E\u0130N KARTI \u0130\u015EARET ET"
  - Key: item.swap_hand.prompt_player
    Value: "KART DE\u011E\u0130\u015EECE\u011E\u0130N K\u0130\u015E\u0130Y\u0130
