  - Key: item.swap_hand.response
    Value: "seninle kart de\u011Fi\u015Ftiriyor - verece\u011Fin kart\u0131 se\xE7"
  - Key: item.table_reveal.name
    Value: Megafon
  - Key: item.table_reveal.description
    Value: "Bu tur, elde kalan her oyuncu t\xFCm masaya rastgele bir kart\u0131n\u0131
